## Invention Disclosure

### Process

| Step | Action | Timeline |
|------|--------|----------|
| 1 | Complete invention disclosure form | Within 30 days |
| 2 | Submit to IP Department | - |
| 3 | Initial review | 14 days |
| 4 | Patent Committee review | 30 days |
| 5 | Decision (file/trade secret/release) | 45 days |

### Disclosure Requirements

| Information | Required |
|-------------|----------|
| Inventors (all) | Yes |
| Detailed description | Yes |
| Prior art known | Yes |
| Potential applications | Yes |
| Public disclosures | Yes |
| Supporting documents | If available |

