## Patent Process

### Decision Criteria

| Factor | Consideration |
|--------|---------------|
| Novelty | Is it truly new? |
| Non-obviousness | Is it inventive? |
| Utility | Is it useful? |
| Strategic Value | Does it protect business? |
| Enforcement | Can we detect infringement? |
| Cost-Benefit | Is filing justified? |

### Filing Strategy

| Strategy | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| Offensive | Protect core innovations |
| Defensive | Prevent competitor patents |
| Licensing | Generate revenue |
| Cross-License | Enable freedom to operate |

### Timeline

| Phase | Typical Duration |
|-------|------------------|
| Disclosure to decision | 45 days |
| Provisional filing | 60 days |
| Full application | 12 months |
| Prosecution | 2-4 years |
| Grant | 3-5 years |

