## Trade Secrets

### Identification

Trade secret status requires:
1. Information provides competitive advantage
2. Information is not publicly known
3. Reasonable measures taken to protect

### Protection Measures

| Measure | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Access Controls | Need-to-know basis |
| Classification | "Trade Secret" marking |
| NDAs | All external parties |
| Employee Agreements | Confidentiality clauses |
| Physical Security | Locked areas, clean desk |
| Digital Security | Encryption, access logs |
| Exit Interviews | Reminder of obligations |

