## Enforcement

### Violation Response

| Violation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Failure to disclose | Counseling, training |
| Unauthorized disclosure | Disciplinary action |
| IP theft | Termination, legal action |
| Competitor infringement | Legal evaluation |

### Infringement Response

| Response | Criteria |
|----------|----------|
| Ignore | De minimis, strategic |
| License | Revenue opportunity |
| Litigation | Significant harm, strategic |

